kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "yaml-dsl-docs-skills-autogen-sync"
purpose: "确保 CLI/LSP 文档和 skill 文档从单一真相源自动生成，避免手工维护重复文案，并通过 QA gate 拦截文档漂移。 [scope-review-2026-07-12-c5-openpyxl-helpers]"
valid_scope[1]: src/scalim/
requirements[4]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r1,YAML DSL CLI reference MUST be generated from CLI parser and shared by docs and,"系统 MUST 以 argparse parser 为命令真相，并将其输出作为 docs-site 与 skill 的共享 reference 来源，禁止手工维护重复文案。 系统 MUST 至少覆盖并可从生成物中发现以下子命令与其 usage/help： - `yaml-dsl validate` - `yaml-dsl schema validate/show/path` - `yaml-dsl upsert-lsp-comment`"
  r2,"Copyable CLI/LSP snippets MUST be injected and hand-written snippets MUST be rej","系统 MUST 将”可复制的命令片段（CLI/LSP）”收敛为 injected blocks，并禁止在 marker 外手写这些片段，以避免与实现漂移。 至少 MUST 覆盖以下文件类型： - workflow 文档 - agent-skill 文档 - skill 文件"
  r3,docs schema reference MUST include demand and workflow schemas,"系统 MUST 以 demand/workflow schema 为字段集合真相，并在 docs-site 的 schema reference 页中同时呈现 demand/workflow 两套字段参考（Top-Level Fields + Definitions）。"
  r4,QA MUST gate docs/skill sync drift for injected snippets,"系统 MUST 提供一个可回归的门禁，用于在 docs/skill 中拦截”可复制片段漂移/遗漏 marker”： - marker 缺失 MUST fail-fast - marker 外出现手写命令片段 MUST fail-fast - 失败信息 MUST 给出明确修复入口"
scenarios[10]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  r1,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r1,"docs-site-provides-a-generated-cli-reference-page",CLI parser 已定义,维护者运行文档生成命令,MUST 生成 CLI reference 页面
  r1,"skill-provides-a-generated-cli-lsp-reference",CLI parser 已定义,维护者运行 skill 生成命令,MUST 生成 skill CLI/LSP reference
  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"required-markers-exist",目标文件已初始化,维护者查看上述文件,"每个文件 MUST 包含对应的 `BEGIN/END AUTOGEN:*` marker"
  r2,"hand-written-snippets-outside-markers-fail-fast",目标文件已包含 marker,维护者在 marker 外写入 CLI 命令片段,QA gate MUST 失败
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,"schema-reference-contains-workflow-fields",demand/workflow schema 已就位,维护者运行文档生成命令,"schema reference 页面 MUST 包含 workflow schema 的 Top-Level Fields/Definitions（不允许仅包含 demand）"
  r4,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r4,"qa-fails-when-a-required-marker-is-missing",目标文件已初始化,"任一目标文件缺少 `BEGIN/END AUTOGEN:*` marker",QA gate MUST 失败并提示补齐 marker 与运行生成入口